{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38432","headline":"追咏棠梨花十韵 · 吴融","name":"追咏棠梨花十韵","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"蜀地从来胜，棠梨第一花。\n更应无软弱，别自有妍华。\n不贵绡爲雾，难降绮作霞。\n移须归紫府，驻合饵丹砂。\n密映弹琴宅，深藏卖酒家。\n夜宜红蜡照，春称锦筵遮。\n连庙魂栖望，飘江字绕巴。\n未饶酥点薄，兼妬雪飞斜。\n旧赏三年断，新期万里赊。\n长安如种得，谁定牡丹夸。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吴融","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_38432.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38432","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}